WEBVTT

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.601
Make sure you don't slip on the drip.

00:06:30.625 --> 00:06:32.518
(Laughter)

00:06:32.542 --> 00:06:36.583
Here we got the 36 Brix
plant-based velato.

00:06:37.292 --> 00:06:39.292
Strawberry fields, you know the deal.

00:06:41.292 --> 00:06:43.184
Compressed watermelon,

00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:44.684
basil seeds,

00:06:44.708 --> 00:06:47.184
a little bit of strawberries up there.

00:06:47.208 --> 00:06:49.976
Back to the Bronx Brasserie,

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:54.601
you know we had to hit them in the head
with that caviar and cornbread.

00:06:54.625 --> 00:06:56.393
(Laughter)

00:06:56.417 --> 00:06:59.000
(Applause)